cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below."
title: "Earthquake-Volcano Proximity Explorer"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based screening tool that lists every Smithsonian GVP Holocene
  volcano within a chosen radius of a selected USGS earthquake, with distance,
  azimuth, last known eruption and activity evidence, on a schematic proximity
  plot and an optional satellite basemap. Intended for rapid screening of which
  volcanoes are worth examining with InSAR after a large earthquake.
type: software
